===Proper noun===
{{ru-proper noun+|Го́спод|nom_sg=Госпо́дь|voc=~и|n=sg|a=an}}

# the [[Lord]], [[God]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Го́споди!|q={{glossary|vocative}}|Good Lord!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не|Не]] [[дать|дай]] '''Госпо́дь'''!|God forbid!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Госпо́дь''' [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!|God only knows!; Who knows?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Госпо́дь''' [[с]] [[ты|тобо́й]]!|Bless you!; ''also:'' Get outta here! (incredulity)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Госпо́дь''' [[с]] [[он|ним]]!|Forget him!}}

====Usage notes====
* It's acceptable to pronounce the first letter "{{m|ru|г}}" as {{IPAchar|/ɣ/}} or {{IPAchar|/ɦ/}} in standard Russian for this word. The [[vocative case]] is more likely to be pronounced with {{IPAchar|/ɣ/}} or {{IPAchar|/ɦ/}}. <!--I've heard this opinion but not sure, how to check for frequencies. Not sure if Vahagn is right here. User:Atitarev -->

